OL,3,ATrump $1 coin makes him first living
OL,4,Apresident on US currency in a century
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe coins - priced at $61 (#45) for a
OL,7,Froll of 25 and a bag of 100 for $154.50
OL,8,F- were "not currently in stock" on the
OL,9,FUS Mint's website within hours of going
OL,10,Fon sale. The BBC contacted the US Mint,
OL,11,Fthe Treasury and the White House for
OL,12,Fdetails.
